<!-- Yogas Tab -->
<div id="yogas" class="tab-content py-10 px-5">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-12 reveal">
      <h2 class="section-title mt-2">YOGAS — SPECIAL COMBINATIONS</h2>
      <p class="section-sub mt-3">
        Yogas are pattern-based combinations that alter the chart's expression. Some produce prominence, some produce ease, and some produce pressure that must be handled carefully.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-5 stagger">
      <div class="branch-card h-full">
        <h4
          class="text-sm font-bold mb-3"
          style="font-family: var(--font-display); color: var(--gold)"
        >
          Supportive Yogas
        </h4>
        <ul
          class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-sm"
          style="color: var(--muted)"
        >
          <li>
            <strong>Pancha Mahapurusha Yogas</strong>
            — Ruchaka, Bhadra, Hamsa, Malavya, Shasha.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Raja Yogas</strong>
            — lords of Kendra and Trikona join or exchange.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Dhana Yogas</strong>
            — wealth-giving combinations involving 2nd, 5th, 9th, and 11th houses.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Gaja Kesari</strong>
            and
            <strong>Amala</strong>
            — wisdom and reputation through benefic structure.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="branch-card h-full">
        <h4
          class="text-sm font-bold mb-3"
          style="font-family: var(--font-display); color: var(--gold)"
        >
          Challenging Patterns
        </h4>
        <ul
          class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-sm"
          style="color: var(--muted)"
        >
          <li>
            <strong>Kemadruma</strong>
            — Moon isolated from support.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Papa Kartari</strong>
            — a house hemmed in by malefics.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Mangal Dosha</strong>
            and
            <strong>Kaal Sarpa</strong>
            — pressure around marriage or life direction.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Sade Sati</strong>
            — Saturn's testing transit over the Moon zone.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 info-box text-center">
      <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--muted)">
        A yoga is never judged in isolation — sign, house, strength, aspect, and timing all decide the final result.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
